 "note": "T.C. Passios Elementary School, identified by the heading 'T.C. Passios Elementary School Staff' on line 19. Lines 1-18 belong to the Elementary School Principal's Report: its title and byline, the 'Enrollment' narrative, and the 'Principal's Advisory Committee' (principal, assistant principal, five teachers and four parents) -- a committee, not the staff list, so ignored even though its staff reappear below. Lines 20-22 print 'Title: Name' (the colon is missing after 'Adm. Secretary'); the title is role_raw. Line 23 'Teachers:' heads lines 24-42, two columns of bare names with no grade or subject printed, so every one carries grade_or_dept 'Teachers' and role_raw ''. Lori MacDougall (42) stands alone in the left column. Line 43 is the page number."
